{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261024/photo/bkn-20261024014750029-1024_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261024022906\"/><p>涉賭被捕男女。</p><p>油尖區警員昨日（23日）在區內進行打擊非法賭博行動，突擊搜查新填地街一個單位，搗破一個懷疑非法賭檔。行動中，拘捕1名63歲姓溫本地男子，涉嫌「管理賭博場所」。另外4名本地男子、4名本地女子及1名內地女子，年齡介乎28至65歲，則涉嫌「在賭博場所內賭博」被捕。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T18:44:27.759833+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:47:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T22:30:05.180954+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:28.217568+00:00","content_hash":"0d3e823a928b147221eb77b21b807dc423aefeed324df9b98bac6d4764c2bccf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}